# Stead Preview — example environment. PLACEHOLDERS ONLY.
#
# The real file lives at $STEAD_DEMO_HOME/.env (default ~/.stead-demo/.env),
# owner-only (mode 600), outside this repository. Never commit it.
# Never paste real values into a chat, a commit, or a systemd unit.

# --- Telegram ---------------------------------------------------------------
# From BotFather, for the "Stead Preview" bot ONLY.
# Must not be the token of any other bot on this machine.
STEAD_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=123456789:REPLACE_WITH_BOTFATHER_TOKEN

# Comma-separated numeric Telegram user IDs allowed to talk to Stead.
# Kerstin's ID only. Everyone else is refused.
STEAD_ALLOWED_TELEGRAM_IDS=000000000

# --- Model: a Stead-owned APPLICATION API key -------------------------------
# This must be an application API key billed to the Stead demo.
# Do NOT use a personal Claude Code / ChatGPT / Gemini CLI subscription
# credential, and do not point Stead at another agent's OAuth tokens.
#
# provider: anthropic | gemini
STEAD_MODEL_PROVIDER=anthropic

# Validated against the installed Hermes catalogue by scripts/check-secrets.sh.
# Known-good on this build: claude-sonnet-4-6, claude-opus-4-8, claude-haiku-4-5
STEAD_MODEL_NAME=claude-sonnet-4-6

# Supply ONLY the credential matching STEAD_MODEL_PROVIDER.
#   anthropic -> https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-REPLACE_ME
#   gemini    -> https://aistudio.google.com/app/apikey
# GEMINI_API_KEY=REPLACE_ME

# --- Locale ------------------------------------------------------------------
STEAD_TIMEZONE=Europe/London

# --- Workspace ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Holds the SQLite database, this .env, and logs. Outside git, mode 700.
STEAD_DEMO_HOME=/home/azureuser/.stead-demo
